SUMMARY:Houston Linux User Group
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested or already invested in the Linux Operating System?\nJoin us at the Houston Linux User Group\, one of the oldest user groups involved with the Linux Operating System. We discuss new trends in operating system usage\, software development\, and current technological trends\, as well as provide one-on-one training or class-based instruction. Learn about how to get more out of your computer or how to leverage any of the Linux-based computational platforms.\nAll are welcome to attend\, regardless of whether you’re a seasoned Linux professional intent on networking or a new Linux user struggling with installation or the command line.\nThis monthly meeting includes all of the standard Houston Linux User Group meeting activities\, which include meet-and-greet\, presentations of personal projects\, multi-meeting classes\, as well as organizational and coordinating announcements. \nVisit our website at: https://www.houstonlinux.org/\nVisit our calendar and the agenda of each week’s meeting at: https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=houstonlinuxusergroup@gmail.com \nJoin us on social media.\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/MPzYfeJz\nReddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/houstonlinuxusergroup/
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/houston-linux-user-group-6/
LOCATION:Ion – Conference Room 029 – 030\, 4201 Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HLUG_Crest.png?ver=1781010980
END:VEVENT
